Video:
Matrox Millenium II with 4MB

Ethernet:
Digital 21041 tulip chip


All hardware works under Linux.

Attempted boot from cd initially works. Hardware is recognised. Install
then fails at the point where the install program should ask for terminal
type. The console prints out a warning in relation to a large change in
time setting (which I expect is related to the unusual epoch used for
