unable to mount the cdrom from this point either by hitting 'C' or by
dropping to a shell and using mount.

I suspect the problem is related to the default kernel not being configured
for a scsi cd-rom. If so I would be very grateful if a suitable kernel or
floppy image could be made available somewhere for ftp. I would be most
happy to provide any further details if necessary.
